<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd rose 7.22 percent or 1.75 rupees to 26 rupees on Friday on expectations of improved growth in 1997, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Plantations which peformed well in 1996, are expected to continmue to do so in 1997 due to good prices and demand,&quot; said a local broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories processes tea leaf bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
